   "titulo": "Talk about a routine",
   "texto": [
    "På: på mandag («on Monday»), på søndag («on Sunday») is used to talk about a specific day. In Spanish, no preposition is added in these examples.",
    "Våkner is «me despierto» and står opp is «I get out of bed.»: they describe two different moments. The Norwegian present retains the same form with jeg and du."
